#: src/features/app/components/setup/SetupWizardSteps.tsx
msgid "The official Fluxer mobile apps receive notifications through Fluxer's push relay, which hands them to Apple and Google. Self-hosted UnifiedPush and ntfy endpoints never reach the relay and need no agreement."
